	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["646ADF5E2F61D70F"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3501: Bees]"
				""
				"Nothing spawns here, and that goes for bees too. NCP's agricultural division ships the first one with your hive."
				"&aThe hive, in two steps:&r a plain &bbeehive&r (six planks, three string: NCP swapped the honeycomb"
				"for string, since you have no bees yet), then the &badvanced beehive&r: three oak planks on top,"
				"string, beehive, string in the middle, a campfire, a plank and shears along the bottom."
				"&aFlowers:&r a bee with nothing to pollinate makes nothing. Bone meal (NCP Shop) on the island's grass"
				"grows plains flowers; a Botany Pot grows more from one. Plant a few right beside the hive."
				"&cBuild the room first.&r A bee out of an egg has no home. It wanders before it looks for a hive, and"
				"out here wandering ends in the void. Put a &bglass box&r round the hive and its flowers (a few blocks"
				"each way, the hive's front face clear) and use the egg &binside&r it. Bees work by day, stay in when it rains."
				"Once a bee has a hive, it comes home. Then you can open the box."
				"&aThe crate also holds a &bSimulation Upgrade&r. In a hive's upgrade slot, its bees stop going out"
				"at all: the hive works out their trips to the flowers by itself. Nobody gets lost that way."
				"&cBut it only looks one place:&r the block &bin front of the hive and one lower&r. Raise the hive a block"
				"so its flower (or a Feeding Slab with flowers in it) sits there, or a simulated bee makes nothing."
				"&7Listen to them for a minute. It's the first thing that's buzzed around here that wasn't a machine."
			]
			id: "1E64986BC9048338"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
					id: "5F13A626FB31B08A"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
