			]
			title: "Bottled"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["278E2B578F380076"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3505: Honey]"
				""
				"Four honey bottles and a bucket make a &bbucket of honey&r: ten combs' worth, a full 1,000 mB."
				"That's the whole trick. Everything after this is doing it more, and deciding where it goes:"
				"the &bSifter Array&r, the &bAtomic Reclaimer&r, or more bees. The quests below point the way."
				"&7Bees won't make you metal here; the strata do that. Bees make everything else go further."
			]
			id: "647A9F38BEF74CD7"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 4
					id: "277C80112892B870"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			shape: "gear"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "2452E923ACAA817B"
					item: "productivebees:honey_bucket"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "A Bucket of Honey"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["647A9F38BEF74CD7" "74C14908A195E46D"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3506: Booster]"
				""
				"Swap one Array casing for a &bULV input hatch&r (by hand: glass, a ULV hull and a rubber plate,"
				"top to bottom) and empty your honey into it. Circuit &b11&r instead of 1: every gravel gives &b8&r strata, not 4."
				"It drinks. You'll find out how much."
				"That's the real job for your bees. Later, the &bCalla Paddy&r takes honey too, beside the water."
				"&7A machine that runs better on honey. NCP would have put that in a brochure."
			]
			id: "4B2A9702E15972D8"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
					id: "05DDD35663B5E9CE"
