			title: "Honey in the Array"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["647A9F38BEF74CD7" "0788A02A25C2D582"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3507: Atoms]"
				""
				"The &bAtomic Reclaimer&r takes bee products too. A honey bottle is glucose: &b6 carbon, 12 hydrogen&r,"
				"&b6 oxygen&r, and you get the bottle back. A honeycomb or a piece of wax is &b4 carbon, 8 hydrogen&r."
				"&7Per item, nothing on the island pays better than a bee. Whether to spin the comb first is your sum to do."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:honey_bottle"
			id: "504045B292D62FC4"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
