					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "4FBE2B8669740841"
					item: "productivebees:stone_nest"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Solitary Nests"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4B900A3C1EF3FE40"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3510: Worker]"
				""
				"Bring a &bGreen Carpenter&r and a &bYellow-Black Carpenter&r together (bee cages help) and feed each"
				"one a flower. Their baby is a &bLumber Bee&r: it lives in an advanced beehive like a honey bee does."
				"Instead of flowers it visits &blogs&r near the hive, and what it brings home is whatever that block"
				"would drop: a log for a log."
				"&7Logs are atoms for the Reclaimer, and these never need replanting."
			]
			icon: "productivebees:spawn_egg_lumber_bee"
			id: "5D08333AD2479F03"
			rewards: [
