			]
			title: "Lumber Bee"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 0.8d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4B900A3C1EF3FE40"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3511: Worker]"
				""
				"A &bChocolate Mining&r bee and a &bDigger&r bee, each fed a flower, make a &bQuarry Bee&r."
				"It works &bstone, sand and gravel&r near its hive and brings home that block's"
				"drop: cobblestone from stone, sand from sand, gravel (now and then flint) from gravel."
				"&7A cobblestone generator that hums. Sand and gravel too, without a hammer."
			]
