			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3512: Worker]"
				""
				"Feed a &bhopper&r to a grown honey bee: right-click the bee with it. It turns into a &bCollector Bee&r."
				"Living in an advanced beehive, it picks up items lying on the ground within &b4 blocks&r"
				"(one more per range upgrade) and puts them in the hive. Leave the hive some room."
				"&7Put one next to anything that drops things. Saplings, mostly."
			]
