		{
			dependencies: ["3AE416EDEA558437" "66E986A4489A0BEF"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #3513: Hazard]"
				""
				"Feed a &bblock of TNT&r to a honey bee and it becomes a &bCreeBee&r. Here TNT comes only from"
				"chemistry (toluene, from your oil, and sulfuric acid in a chemical reactor), so this one waits."
				"Its &bpowdery comb&r goes in the bee centrifuge: half the time &bgunpowder&r, always wax and 50 mB of honey."
				"&cIt explodes when angered.&r Give it a hive of its own, far from anything you like."
				"&7NCP's Agricultural Division filed this under 'pest control'. Nobody asked which pest."
			]
			id: "34E82D3FA2ADE942"
